<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body>
    <table style="width: 100%; float: left; border: 5px solid #0000000d; padding: 0px 10px;" border="0">
      
      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_HEADER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

          <p>
            We have been trying to contact you to remind you that your loan re-payment is overdue for {{company_name_show}}, but you are not responding to our calls, nor replying to our messages.
          </p>

          <p>
            Maybe you are facing some difficulties. Our representative would be visiting you tomorrow and try to understand your situation. Kindly indicate a suitable time. He will come to discuss in what way we can help.
          </p>

          <p>
            In case we don’t hear from you, we will plan an unscheduled visit to address the issue.
          </p>

          <p>
            You may, however, make the payment by visiting the following link:  
            <a href="{{los_server_name}}/repayment" target="_blank" alt="Click To Pay">Click To Pay</a>
          </p>

          <p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>

          <p>Best regards,</p>
          <p>{{company_name_show}} Team</p>
        </td>
      </tr>

      <tr>
        <td>
          <img src="{{SERVER_DOMAIN_NAME_FOOTER}}" style="width: 100%;" />
        </td>
      </tr>

    </table>
  </body>
</html>
